window.products.push({"id":784046,"name":"Portable Blender, Smoothie Blender with 16oz Travel Glass Cup and Lid 4000mAh Battery Strong Power Personal Size Blender USB Rechargeable Mini Juicer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QaGWxHpRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Safe Material and Operational safety】: Portable blender bottle made of high borosilicate glass material, Baby Food Grade, BPA Free, CE Approved, could be used to make baby food supplement. The built-in safety Mechanical safety device had upgraded to the newest micro-motion safer device, ensures the blender could not be operated if the components are not assembled properly, is safer than magnetic induction. 【Lightweight but Powerful】: Coming with 4000mAh lithium-ion battery (2*2000mAh rchargeble batterys), 6 blades 304 stainless steel, this small blender has more powerful and faster speed,can produce around 15 cups of juice after a full charge of 3 hours. Simply one button and hold 2sec to start, powerful enough to blend ice, frozen fruits, vegetables, seeds in only 30sec. 【Portable & Convenient to Charge】: With built-in battery & USB cable, this personal blender can be easily charged by power bank, laptop, computer or other USB devices. Mini blender with intimate compact design, offer you a pleasant taste experience, Blend and drink from the Jar. The petite size makes it the perfect blender for home, office, or travel. 【Easy to Take Away and Easy to Clean】: With the supplementary bottom lid, you can easily take away the juicer cup without the Electric base after juicing. It's more light weight. This cordless blender detachable, easy to clean, Easy to flush, Cleaning way: Pour water to 3/4 of the cup, turn on the blender for about 5 second, then pour out the dirty water. Also, the juicer cup's body and bottom can be separated to be clean. (Please keep the base away from the water when cleaning.) 【Multi-function & Super Convenient】: As opposed to a tranditional countertop blender: quiet, less messy, fewer dishes, space saving. Perfect for making personal milkshake, fruit smoothies, juice, protein shake, baby food supplement, salad dressings,etc. It’s very portable for traveling, camping, fishing etc. A great portable blende for people who are on the go and want something fresh!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QaGWxHpRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIKOCO","source_asin":"B0BD73WMDN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD73WMDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD73WMDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
