window.products.push({"id":784195,"name":"hOmeLabs Bottom Loading Water Dispenser for 3 or 5 Gallon Bottle - with Hot Cold and Room Temperature Settings Stainless Steel Design and LED Night Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZVMXMSE+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY BOTTOM LOADING DESIGN - Now it’s easy to keep yourself hydrated with our bottom load water dispenser. Gone are the days of “flip and drip” trying to lift a heavy water bottle onto a dispenser. With our machine you simply load the water bottle inside the drink dispenser door and insert the probe into the bottle. It’s that easy. FOR 3 TO 5 GALLON JUGS & FITS ANY SPACE - Stylish water cooler dispenser with stainless steel door adds a modern touch to every water cooler conversation and parties. Measures just 40.9 x 14.2 x 12.2 inches to fit any space in your home, office or gym INTUITIVE CONTROL PANEL WITH NIGHT LIGHT- Features an LED night light that helps you get water during the night without opening any room light. This instant cooler also has a refill bottle alert to inform you when you need to replenish the water bottle in the reservoir. Oh, and of course you can choose between hot, cold, and room temperature water. CHILD SAFETY LOCK FEATURE - Kids in the house? Clumsy adults? The child safety lock feature located on the unit prevents accidentally pressing the hot water button. 2-YEAR WARRANTY & MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - 100% satisfaction money-back guarantee. If you are not happy with your hOmeLabs water dispenser, contact us directly through Buyer messaging and we will do everything we can to make things right","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZVMXMSE+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hOmeLabs","source_asin":"B07TDCVX88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TDCVX88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TDCVX88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
