window.products.push({"id":784487,"name":"Laguna Luna | Bridesmaid Proposal Box | Will You Be My Bridesmaid | Empty Mailer Gift Box for Bridesmaid Proposal (Bridesmaid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SFbFGjvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Congratulations on your engagement! Now that you’re engaged, it’s time to assemble your “I do” crew by popping the question to the ladies who will stand up and be by your side on your big day!   Do you want a memorable and stylish way to ask your bridesmaids to be a part of your big day? Invite your best friends to be a part of your bride tribe with our unique Laguna Luna proposal boxes! Each premium box is made of corrugated cardboard and is the perfect memento to have, to hold, and to cherish.   Each luxury box features a matte blush pink exterior with a glossy white interior with silver foil details that reflect in the light.   Contents: one bridesmaid proposal box to fill as you please   Dimensions  Length: 9.25\" / 235 mm  Width: 6.25\" / 155 mm  Height: 4\" / 103 mm  Please note that due to the way the box is assembled, there may be a slight deviation of up to 0.1 inch (2-3 mms) in the dimensions provided above.   Material: 300g CCNB + Eflute corrugated cardboard   It's not just what's on the outside that counts! This box is not only beautiful on the outside, but also permeates quality from within. Thicker than your standard mailer, this gorgeous box is everything you look for in a keepsake! It will not warp or become misshapen when filled with heavier objects or going through the postal system.* Just like your friendship, this box can weather hard times.   *Please note that if you plan on sending fragile or delicate items, it is recommended that you use proper packing materials to ensure the items reach their destination safely. Please check with your local post office or shipping company to determine what you may or may not send through the mail.   Please note that this box ships flat. To assemble, fold along the guided creases.   Show your bridesmaids how much they mean to you when you present them this luxe box filled with your thoughtfully curated gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SFbFGjvrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laguna Luna","source_asin":"B07NKZ4D12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NKZ4D12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NKZ4D12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
