window.products.push({"id":784530,"name":"Boot Butler Boot Rack – As Seen On Rachael Ray – Clean Up Your Closet Floor with Hanging Boot Storage – Easy to Assemble & Built to Last – 5-Pair Boot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LVi4j8aGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No More Piles Of Boots On The Floor Of Your Closet, & No More Scuffs, Dents & Creases On Your Beloved Boots! Let’s be honest – our boots are usually some of our favorite footwear, aren’t they? But storing them is a pain. Most people go one of two ways: Either you’ve got a pile of boots on the floor of your closet right now, or you’ve got the boots still in their boxes taking up all the space on the top shelves of your closet AND your closet floor. Sound about right? Boot Butler fixes that, and fast. Each Boot Butler holds five pairs of your boots. It hangs them straight, keeps the shafts rigid and allows them to naturally maintain their shape. It will also make sure they stay free from the creases and scuffing that is inevitable when you “store” them in a big heap on the ground, and it won’t mark or dent the leather like other boot storage solutions. But the best part really? It frees up your storage space so you can fit even more shoes in your closet! - Easy assembly, snaps together in minutes - 5 year warranty - Featured on Rachael Ray with Organization Expert Peter Walsh - Takes up just 7 inches of closet space and holds 5 pairs of boots! - See and access all your boots with ease. You’re probably tired of having to step over various pairs of boots whenever you go into your closet, and this boot hanger is the perfect solution for that. 30,000 + customers can’t be wrong, so order today and see for yourself why customers love their Boot Butlers! US Pat. No. 9326629; CN Pat. No. 104640483","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LVi4j8aGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boot Butler","source_asin":"B00N621FYO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N621FYO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N621FYO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
