window.products.push({"id":784573,"name":"Suuker Heat Resistant Silicone Spatula, Professional Non-Stick Silicone Butter Cake Cream Spatula With Wooden Core For Cooking, Baking,Scraping And Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31A8p-NnoAS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Rugged Wooden Core】The sturdy wooden handle creates a spatula that is tough enough to hold a spatula. Meaning the spatula can stand up to the harsh use of home cooks and professional chefs without breaking like cheap plastic store brands. 【Food Quality Silicone】The head of our spatula is made of food-grade silicone for durability and reliable use. The smooth surface makes it easy to spread brownie or cake batter in the pan, while the flexible edge allows you to scrape the last bit of batter or sauce out of the bowl or pan. 【Removable Head】The silicone head can be pulled off the wooden handle for easy cleaning. The head is dishwasher safe, but the wood should be hand washed to prevent cracking. 【Best Assistant For Baking】Silicone spatula is widely used in baking, stirring cream, chocolate, butter, flour, etc; Beating cream and eggs, smoothing the surface of cakes with our spatula to make them more beautiful. Suitable for professional dessert chefs and baking enthusiasts. 【Professional Non-Stick】It costs a lot of money to replace scratched cookware. This heat-resistant spatula for cooking has a bendable silicone tip that is gentle on cookware, leaving the coating and surface unmarked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31A8p-NnoAS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suuker","source_asin":"B097Y7MCQW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097Y7MCQW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097Y7MCQW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
