window.products.push({"id":784690,"name":"HotMat Electric Food Warming Tray - Compact & Portable - Dual Warming Temperatures - Perfect for Shabbos, Home & Travel - TV SD Safety Certified","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WW68siulL._AC_.jpg","description":"The perfect temperature means a perfect meal. The innovative new HotMat Food Warming Tray is a unique space-saving solution for all your food-filled home gatherings. Pioneering mica heating elements offer a powerful, reliable warming surface for keeping dishes piping hot or above room temperature, depending on your needs. The unit features four circular hobs that fold compactly so you can store it in a drawer, on a shelf, or in your bag for travel. Forget bulky, cumbersome metal buffet trays and dangerous sternos. The HotMat is incredibly lightweight, simple to operate, and features a durable Teflon coating for long-lasting protection and easy wipe down. With international patents and certification from the Standards Institute of Israel, the HotMat is your go-to warming tray for cocktail parties, holidays, and Shabbos dinner. What’s in the Box? - 1 HotMat Four-Dish Warming Tray - The Most Innovative Warming Solution - A Fun, Stylish Essential for Your Kitchen Specs & Details - Voltage/Power: 120V/300W - Dimensions: 20”x20”x¾” (in use) - Dimensions: 10”x10”x8” (folded) - Hot Hob Average Temperature: 338°F - Warm Hob Average Temperature: 230°F - TÜV SÜD Safety Certified - Standards Institute of Israel certified How to Enjoy - Unfold HotMat unit and plug into a power source - Place hot meal in pot or pan and rest atop hob - Enjoy steaming hot, delicious food all day and night long - Let cool, wipe clean, fold and store conveniently!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WW68siulL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HotMat","source_asin":"B01E7SU2CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E7SU2CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E7SU2CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
