window.products.push({"id":784733,"name":"ViscoSoft Microfiber All Seasons Down Alternative Comforter - Cooling Breathable Premium Soft Reversible Microfiber Duvet Blanket, Light Gray/Dark Gra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5TvFkzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We Wear Our Small Business Badge with Pride we're a small but mighty Charlotte, NC based business that's proud of our products. Instead of spending millions on unnecessary overhead or Superbowl ads we put all our money into our products allowing for exceptional quality at a great deal. Our team literally sleeps on these products to ensure they deliver the best experience. 2-In-1 Perfect for All Seasons Reversible Comforter - Customize your bed with a simple flip of the covers. Reversible design allows you to have two different color options in one comforter. Versatile as a duvet insert or as a stand-alone comforter. Soft & Airy - Filled with Vicosoft's breathable fluffy microfiber material providing light and luxurious sleep. The 350 gsm microfiber quilt allows for evenly distributed filler that prevents any clumping or shifting. Comfort For All Seasons - No need to buy lightweight blankets for the summer or heavy blankets for the winter. This alternative down bedspread provides the right amount of thickness for warmth year-round. Add Your Own Duvet and Easy Cleaning - Sewn corner loops means you can easily add a duvet cover. Simply tie it to the 8 corner loops. Fits inside standard size duvet covers. Simply throw in with other bedding on a normal wash cycle. Dry on lower heat, microfiber will dry fast. Did We Mentioned We’re Located in the USA? – Unlike a lot of sellers, we are located in our home office in Charlotte, NC. This means our product has a 60-Day [No Hassle] Money Back Guarantee - As a leading USA-based brand, we stand behind all our products with a commitment to producing premium products. If you change your mind, return your comforter for a FULL refund within the first 60 days after purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S5TvFkzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ViscoSoft","source_asin":"B0BV3H1BLG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV3H1BLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV3H1BLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
