window.products.push({"id":784840,"name":"Belffin Modular Sectional Sofa with Ottomans Velvet Reversible Sleeper Chaise Bed Storage Seat Blue…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2049.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oVJmH4MrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modular Sleeper Sofa: The modular sectional sofa features with elegant double piping, clear lines, and cozy 3 colors that brings minimalist style to a living space. The velvet fabric is soft and high-quality which stands up well to wear and tear. Simple and generous appearance and comfortable seat experience constitute the basic charming of modular sofa. Multi-function Modular Sofa: The seats of the sleeper sofa are movable so the modular sofa can be convertible into any shapes you like. The sectional sofa is suitable for your living room seating needs or can be rearranged into a sleeper sofa to meet the needs of lying and sleeping. The modular sofa bed can accommodate maximum for people who are 6.1 feet tall. Customized Modular Design: The modular sleeper sofa has the human-oriented design, offering the same fabrics and geometric design so that you can expand it easily, not just when you first buy it, but for years to come, maybe you want something without arms or even without a sectional, U-shaped to suit a large space; or you need to integrate your coffee table into the couch, this sofa can meet your all various requirements. Adjustable Modes of Backrest and Armrest: The backrest and armrest support adjustment within 135°to help you find the ideal sitting or resting angle, fully relax your body and relieve fatigue. It is a perfect place for you to watch TV, read magazines, take a nap. Storage-friendly Seats: There are storage spaces under each seat of modular sectional 9-piece couch. It is convenient for you to make the room neat and clean. Storage dimensions: 22.40''(L)*22.40''(W)\"*5.70\"(H). Easy assembly: The modular sectional sofa needs to be assembled. No tools needed and easy to follow instructions to assemble. Overall sofa size: 90.2”(W)*84.7”(L)*33.4”(H). Bed size:79.2”(L)*79.2”(W). The modular sofa comes in 9 packages that may arrive separately within different days. Care Instructions: Vacuum occasionally and use a soft brush to remove particles. To spot clean before a full clean, use a dry cloth with soap and water and apply pressure in a circular motion, avoiding harsh chemicals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oVJmH4MrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belffin","source_asin":"B0BPHH96K1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPHH96K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPHH96K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
