window.products.push({"id":784899,"name":"New York Map by Michael Tompsett, 18 by 24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WlpVThCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful map of the state of New York. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WlpVThCML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00EQYJW7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EQYJW7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EQYJW7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":784900,"name":"Konitz Cappuccino Coffee Cups Set, 2 Cappuccino Cups Set of 4, Coffee Cup Set w/Saucers, Porcelain Cappuccino Cup, Latte Cup, or Tea Cup Set, 8.1 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZD2yAh0L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Konitz Coffee Cup and Saucer Set of 8 (8.1 oz): Imagine yourself visiting the coasts of Capri, Rome’s cafes, or Tuscany’s vineyards as you relax with your favorite beverage in our Italian-style white mugs. Designed for espresso topped with foam milk, each cup for cappuccino ensures long-lasting flavor. This set includes 2 packs of white coffee mugs set of 4 for a total of 8 fancy coffee cups. When you don’t need quite as much caffeine, use our cups as tea cups and saucers or for a rich cup of hot chocolate. Or, if you’re looking for a creativity challenge, test your foam drawing skills with this perfect latte art cup with a wide brim to stabilize your creations. This porcelain cup and saucers set is made of durable, high-quality porcelain and is dishwasher and microwave safe. Gift our coffee set to any coffee lover today to bring a smile to their face. --- Details: - Each latte mug measures 5” L x 5” W x 2.5” H. – Each of the Konitz latte cups has a capacity of 8.1 oz. --- About Us: In 1909, Konitz Porcelain was founded with four circular kilns. Today, Konitz is Europe’s leading supplier of coffee and tea mugs and related products. Our brand is a synonym of excellent design and beautiful finishes. Konitz cups, mugs, & saucers are designed for every taste and occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZD2yAh0L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Konitz","source_asin":"B07FN7HNQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-784900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FN7HNQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FN7HNQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
